People Operations,

For the Requisition Alpha interview cycle, apply the interview conflict and
candidate-data handling controls before the 16:30 JST calibration checkpoint.
The role is People Analytics Partner with three planned openings; the stated
JPY 7.2-8.4M range is role-level planning context only and must not be used in
individual discussion or records.

Required control check
1. Confirm each panel alias used the common prompt set, timebox, and rubric.
2. Confirm scorecards contain candidate IDs A01-A05 and job-related evidence
   only; remove personal or unnecessary detail before retention.
3. Record any declared conflict or process exception through the approved
   People Operations route before calibration; do not resolve it in the thread.
4. Hold candidate-status communications until the completeness check closes.

Owner and next step: People Operations records the control outcome; Recruiting
Operations may issue neutral updates only after that outcome is complete. Log
the outcome against this message ID in 03-mailbox-action-log.log.

Policy Owner
Orchid People
Internal operating guidance; not legal advice.

--p15-policy-followup-20260818
